{"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Advanced","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/CustomStyleLayerExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/RenderingStatisticsHud"],"anchor":"Advanced"}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Plugin API","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Extend MapLibre iOS with native code."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/pluginapi"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"aside","name":"Warning","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The plugin API is experimental and does not yet have stability guarantees."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"warning"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MapLibre Native has a C plugin API for extending it with native code. Currently, plugins can add style layer types. After a plugin registers its layer types, styles can use them like the built-in layer types, for example "},{"code":"\"type\": \"ngon\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Layers of plugin types appear as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"code":"MLNStyle.layers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The API is defined in "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/include\/mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h"},{"type":"text","text":", which documents the ownership and threading rules that plugins must follow."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A plugin describes a layer type with the structures of ","type":"text"},{"code":"plugin_api.h","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The name of the layer type, as used for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"type\""},{"type":"text","text":" in a style."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The paint properties of the layer, with their type, default value and the kinds of expressions they accept.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The shaders of the layer. On iOS, which renders with Metal, a plugin provides the complete Metal Shading Language source with its entry points."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Callbacks that turn the features of a tile into vertex data, update the uniforms of the shaders and answer queries for rendered features."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Add MapLibre with the plugin API","anchor":"Add-MapLibre-with-the-plugin-API"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only the build of MapLibre iOS distributed as the Swift package "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" exports the plugin API. Apart from that, it is the same as the standard build, and applications keep using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import MapLibre"},{"type":"text","text":". Use it instead of the standard package, not in addition to it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package has two products:"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Product","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use it in","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Contents","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MapLibre"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Applications","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MapLibre.xcframework"},{"text":" with the plugin API enabled.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MapLibrePluginApi"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Plugin packages"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The C plugin API, included as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h>"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The GitHub release of each MapLibre iOS version also includes a static XCFramework of this build, ","type":"text"},{"code":"MapLibre.static.plugins.xcframework.zip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Write a plugin","level":2,"anchor":"Write-a-plugin","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A plugin package depends only on ","type":"text"},{"code":"MapLibrePluginApi","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so the application decides which MapLibre framework it links. Both products come from the same package, so Swift Package Manager resolves the header and the framework to the same version.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["dependencies: [","    .package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api\", exact: \"<version>\"),","],","targets: [","    \/\/ Application","    .target(name: \"App\", dependencies: [.product(name: \"MapLibre\", package: \"maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api\")]),","    \/\/ Plugin","    .target(name: \"MyLayer\", dependencies: [.product(name: \"MapLibrePluginApi\", package: \"maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api\")]),","]"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the plugin does not link MapLibre, it does not call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mln_plugin_register_v1"},{"type":"text","text":" itself. Instead it exposes a function that receives the registration function and passes its descriptor to it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["#include <mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h>","","mln_plugin_status my_layer_register(mln_plugin_register_function_v1 register_plugin,","                                    char *error_message,","                                    size_t error_message_capacity) {","    if (!register_plugin) return MLN_PLUGIN_STATUS_NOT_FOUND;","    return register_plugin(&descriptor, error_message, error_message_capacity);","}"],"syntax":"c","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"descriptor"},{"type":"text","text":" is the "},{"code":"mln_plugin_descriptor_v1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of the plugin. Set "},{"code":"struct_size","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of every structure to the size of its type, as "},{"code":"plugin_api.h","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" describes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Register-a-plugin","text":"Register a plugin"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The application passes "},{"code":"mln_plugin_register_v1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to the plugin. Register all plugins before creating a map that loads a style using their layer types:"}]},{"syntax":"objc","code":["#import <MapLibre\/MapLibre.h>","#include \"my_layer.hpp\" \/\/ includes <mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h>","","char error[512] = {};","mln_plugin_status status = my_layer_register(&mln_plugin_register_v1, error, sizeof(error));","if (status != MLN_PLUGIN_STATUS_OK && status != MLN_PLUGIN_STATUS_ALREADY_REGISTERED) {","    NSLog(@\"Failed to register plugin: %s\", error);","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Registration is process-wide and thread-safe. Registering the same plugin again returns "},{"code":"MLN_PLUGIN_STATUS_ALREADY_REGISTERED","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Plugins cannot be unregistered."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/tree\/main\/plugins\/ngon-layer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" in the repository is an example plugin. It draws regular polygons at point features and registers the "},{"code":"ngon","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" layer type with "},{"code":"mln_ngon_layer_register","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/PluginAPI","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"references":{"https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/blob/main/include/mln/plugin/plugin_api.h":{"titleInlineContent":[{"code":"plugin_api.h","type":"codeVoice"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/include\/mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/include\/mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h","title":"plugin_api.h"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/RenderingStatisticsHud":{"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/renderingstatisticshud","type":"topic","title":"Rendering Statistics HUD","abstract":[{"text":"Show rendering statistics on the map","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/RenderingStatisticsHud","role":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"MLNStyle","fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The pro